<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN"
        "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
    <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8"/>
</head>
<body>

<p>Dear $assigneeName,</p>

<p>Please be informed that $creatorName have added a new document to $documentUploadToIssueName issue
    on $creationDate </p>

<div style='background-color:lightblue; width:100%;'>
    <p>Document name: $fileName</p>

    <p>Description: $description</p>
</div>

<p>Click <a href="$host/ProjectManagement.html?link=$link" title="View issue">here</a> to view the document</p>

<p>* If you are not able to click on the link, you can instead copy and paste the following address in to your web
    browser:
    <span style="color: #0033FF">$host/ProjectManagement.html?link=$link</span></p>

</body>
</html>